00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.627
My name is Jon Stewart,

00:00:01.627 --> 00:00:02.836
and welcome to The Problem.

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.379
This is the new variant.

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:06.006
There's a lot going
on in the world.

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:07.424
We need an executive action,

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:08.508
put out the signal.

00:00:08.926 --> 00:00:10.219
Save us Dark Brandon.

00:00:10.219 --> 00:00:11.303
[laughs]

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:14.097
98% of the young people

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:15.724
who have gender dysphoria,

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:17.768
are able to move past that-

00:00:17.768 --> 00:00:20.020
That's an incredibly
made up figure.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:23.232
♪♪

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.777
We worked hard on this.

